          <register>
            <name>INTMSKPHYFATAL</name>
            <description>Interrupt mask for INT_ST_PHY_FATAL controls which interrupt status bits trigger the interrupt pin. Bit at 1 - Enable the interrupt source. Bit at 0 - Interrupt source is masked.</description>
