            <description>This register stores 39-08 bits of the Response Field for an SD/eMMC mode.  The response for an SD/eMMC command can be a maximum of 128 bits. These 128 bits are segregated into four 32-bit registers: RESP01_R, RESP23_R, RESP45_R and RESP67_R.</description>
